{"script":"s_2_6_3_y","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":0,"scaleX":0.9,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":157,"y":-466.79999999999995,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara042_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":157,"transTime":300,"y":-466.79999999999995,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara042_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]哇……这就是你做的战场道具吗……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]这座路障果然比他们搭建的坚固了许多。弩台的威力看上去也增强了不少。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]了不起……感觉又看到了很厉害的东西呢。冒险果然处处都会带来惊喜。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]这些新设施肯定能帮到这边的冒险者。如此一来，他们防御营地的压力肯定就会小很多了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]那些魔物知道这里有所防备，也会逐渐减少对这里的攻势的。等这里的问题解决之后，我也可以放心去继续冒险了……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]你们也是热情的冒险者，既帮助了他们，也帮助了我。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":157,"transTime":300,"y":-466.79999999999995,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara042_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]说起来我有些好奇……你为什么那么愿意无偿帮助其他人啊？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":157,"transTime":300,"y":-466.79999999999995,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara042_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]这个嘛……说来话长啊。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]还记得我之前说过的……我的故乡白沙荒原吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]那里的资源非常稀少，每天都爆发着为了争夺资源的残酷斗争。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]我看到过太多同类相残之事了。比起敌对相残，我还是更希望大家能以合作的姿态，共同在这个残酷的深渊里生存下去……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]所以我作为冒险者，走到每一个地方，都会尽量帮助当地的人们解决问题。制止相互攻伐，提倡相互合作。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":157,"transTime":300,"y":-466.79999999999995,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara042_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"原来是这样……","tag":"tag_17"},{"text":"我也有同感。","tag":"tag_17"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":157,"transTime":300,"y":-466.79999999999995,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara042_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show][cm]当然了，面对同样是冒险者的人，我更要出手相助了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"帕扎迪恩","text":"[show]虽然我也不清楚这里的人在调查着什么，但是敢在魔物聚集的山顶附近呆着，也是很了不起的冒险者呀。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":true,"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.9,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":157,"transTime":300,"y":-466.79999999999995,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara042_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]没错。他们的确是很了不起的冒险者。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":50,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":tr